        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BMRC.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BMRC-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH341-GAMMA-7-8THS-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH342-LYAPUNOV-DECAY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH343-SCSI-IPC-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH344-TOTIENT-ZERO-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH345-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BMRC-WIT            PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BMRC.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-BMRC.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH341-GAMMA-7-8THS-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH342-LYAPUNOV-DECAY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH343-SCSI-IPC-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH344-TOTIENT-ZERO-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH345-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-BMRC-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-BMRC-WIT.
